WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose the topic and consumer group
Illustrative AIO fixture: stopped consumers with retained records.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Set a meaningful threshold
Use a lag threshold agreed for this workload, not a universal health score.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Capture a bounded observation
This reads Kafka metadata and offsets; it does not measure broker CPU or disk.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Read findings with their evidence
Lag with no active members is a lead to check, not a root-cause verdict.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Inspect the partition positions
Compare committed and end positions; preserve the observation time and scope.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Follow the next check
Inspect the group and its members before deciding on a recovery action.
